<title>SWITZERLAND: Trade in Porst, Distefora suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Porst, Distefora suspended.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss Exchange said it had suspended trading in the shares of Porst Holding AG and Distefora Holding AG pending important announcements by the two companies.</p>
<p>A statement from the exchange on Friday said trading in the shares and debt of Distefora, previously named Interdiscount Holding AG, would be suspended at least until 1100 GMT.  </p>
<p>Distefora has agreed to sell its interests in Porst Holding and Interdisount France to Belgium's Spector Photo Group NV.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
